      "message": "This shouldn\u0027t be reset to 0 until after the `if (!dawnBuffer)` or we could get into a weird state where one `findOrCreateDawnBuffer` fails and then subsequent `add()` calls see we still have the old `fCurrentBuffer` but a slots used count of 0 and overwrite prior slots accidentally.",
